    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Total sales reached $2.3M but profit margin remains at only 12.5%
        • High cost structure consuming 87.5% of revenue before reaching profit
        • Gap of $2M between gross sales and final profit indicates significant operational expenses

        Recommendations:
        • Analyze cost structure to identify expense reduction opportunities
        • Focus on higher-margin products to improve overall profitability
        • Review pricing strategy to optimize profit margins without losing sales volume
